{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100 Caliber Dash</strong> hurls you into a neon-soaked death race. In a high-stakes, retro-futuristic stadium, you tear through drone-infested courses, gunning for the fastest time. One timer, ten escalating levels, no second chances. Speed, precision, and style reign supreme. Climb the leaderboard or crash in the chaos. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd38\u00a0<strong>Fluid Movement</strong>:\u00a0Fast walking, dashing, and double jumps let you weave through the chaos with precision and elegance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/extras/Movement.gif?t=1743182012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Asymmetrical Dual-Wielding</strong>: Fire independently with a <strong>light, rapid-fire pistol</strong> in one hand and a <strong>heavy, hard-hitting pistol</strong> in the other, each with separate magazines to maintain relentless momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Explosive Eye Lasers</strong>:\u00a0Unleash devastating laser blasts on command, acting as a powerful third weapon to clear threats and keep up the pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/extras/Arsenal.gif?t=1743182012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Evolving Arsenal</strong>:\u00a0Gain powerful perks at the end of each level, enhancing your pistols and eye lasers to create deadly synergies tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Ever-Increasing Challenge</strong>:\u00a0Face escalating enemy waves, evolving hazards, and fierce competition on the live online leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/extras/Challenge.gif?t=1743182012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Retrowave Aesthetic</strong>:\u00a0A neon-drenched stadium and pulsating synthwave soundtrack bring this competition to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/extras/Stadium.gif?t=1743182012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2609550?t=1743182012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743182012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/b0370bdf0d4c6f20562c880953c37651af182d0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743182012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609550/b0370bdf0d4c6f20562c880953c37651af182d0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743182012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3582700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100 Caliber Dash</strong> hurls you into a neon-soaked death race. In a high-stakes, retro-futuristic stadium, you tear through drone-infested courses, gunning for the fastest time. One timer, ten escalating levels, no second chances. Speed, precision, and style reign supreme. Climb the leaderboard or crash in the chaos. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\